        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>（序）我不是你</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body {\n      margin: 0;\n      width: 100%;\n      min-height: 100%;\n    }\n    body {\n      background: #d9d9d5;\n      overflow-x: hidden;\n    }\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 460px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      color: #f0f0ed;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 8%, rgba(255,255,255,.045) 0 1px, transparent 2px),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 74% 17%, rgba(255,255,255,.035) 0 1px, transparent 2px),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 41% 47%, rgba(255,255,255,.025) 0 1px, transparent 2px),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 88% 76%, rgba(255,255,255,.04) 0 1px, transparent 2px),\n        linear-gradient(108deg, #242523 0%, #1b1c1b 48%, #242522 100%);\n      background-size: 7px 9px, 11px 13px, 9px 8px, 13px 12px, auto;\n      box-shadow: inset -1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.4);\n    }\n    .title {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 58px;\n      left: 67px;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n      font-size: 21px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      letter-spacing: .4px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .title small {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      vertical-align: 3px;\n      margin-right: 4px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n    .text {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 160px;\n      left: 48px;\n      width: 363px;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 22px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      letter-spacing: .15px;\n      text-align: center;\n      text-shadow: 0 0 .3px rgba(255,255,255,.8);\n    }\n    .para { margin: 0 0 4px; }\n    .signature.placeholder {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 225px;\n      top: 617px;\n      width: 178px;\n      height: 65px;\n    }\n    .signature svg {\n      display: block;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      overflow: visible;\n    }\n    .signature path {\n      fill: none;\n      stroke: #e8e8e2;\n      stroke-width: 1.35;\n      stroke-linecap: round;\n      stroke-linejoin: round;\n      opacity: .92;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"title\"><small>（序）</small>我不是你</div>\n\n    <section class=\"text\">\n      <p class=\"para\">我有幸能和来自于世界各地、风格迥异的人们一起，制作<br>了许多不同的电影。</p>\n      <p class=\"para\">我为我们对彼此包容感到自豪。我们将各自的能量联结在<br>一起，拍出了在力所能及的范围内最好的电影。我们尽可能真<br>实地去分享作品的意义和思想。</p>\n      <p class=\"para\">但我不是你。</p>\n      <p class=\"para\">我不是那些难民。他们为了逃离战火，冒着失去生命和至<br>亲的危险，坐上并不适于航海的船只，贸然出海。</p>\n      <p class=\"para\">我不是那些巴勒斯坦人。他们为了自己的家乡与信仰，奋<br>起抗争。</p>\n      <p class=\"para\">我不是那些原住民女孩。她们被残忍地从母亲身边夺走，<br>为了回家，不得不走上几千公里。</p>\n      <p class=\"para\">我甚至不是一个在中国土生土长的孩子。我学着去了解自<br>己的身份，试图拼凑出这个不断变化的世界。我想要理解生<br>活，但我不是你。我希望能与你并肩。我唯一能做的，就是分<br>享我们的故事，赋予它们应有的色彩，光线和形式。</p>\n      <p class=\"para\">为此，我感谢所有人。我有幸负起这份重大的责任。我有<br>幸可以源源不断地汲取讯息，再把它们传递、分享给世人。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"signature placeholder\" aria-label=\"[Signature: bottom-center]\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 178 65\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"[Signature]\">\n        <path d=\"M4 28 C17 28, 29 28, 43 27 C49 27, 53 26, 57 28\n                 C53 34, 45 40, 41 47 C39 51, 42 54, 47 49\n                 C53 42, 56 30, 60 14\n                 M55 31 C66 29, 79 27, 93 25\n                 C87 31, 78 39, 73 45 C68 52, 70 57, 75 54\n                 C82 49, 88 38, 92 28\n                 C95 20, 98 10, 100 4\n                 M98 26 C106 23, 112 22, 119 24\n                 C124 26, 123 31, 119 37\n                 C117 42, 119 47, 123 46\n              